sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator
    participant RossoCortex as RossoCortex (Agent + Envoy)
    participant Keycloak
    participant Target

    Note over Operator: 1. Reconciles AgentRuntime CRs,<br/>labels target workloads
    Operator->>Keycloak: 2. Register client
    RossoCortex->>Keycloak: 3. Get token
    Keycloak-->>RossoCortex: Token (aud: agent's ID)
    RossoCortex->>Target: 4. Request + token
    Note over RossoCortex: 5. Envoy+ext-proc validates token<br/>(signature, expiration, issuer via JWKS)<br/>then exchanges for target audience
    RossoCortex->>Keycloak: Exchange token
    Keycloak-->>RossoCortex: Token (aud: target)
    RossoCortex->>Target: Forward with exchanged token
    Target->>Target: 6. Validate audience — "authorized"
